/extras/d826de8ebbc280d1a0a0847f9e80e730.mp4?t=1756781606\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play with your friends, or by yourself on multiple different maps, each with unique mechanics, to unlock skins, hats, and other customization items to show off your skill! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(Bragging rights included)</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u>BUILD TO WIN</u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight to get the resources you need off of the conveyor belt, and build your order. Watch out for your opponent trying to sabotage you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738160/extras/4850a9ce170a31113ee33fe6449edf0d.poster.avif?t=1756781606\" width=800 height=192 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738160/extras/4850a9ce170a31113ee33fe6449edf0d.webm?t=1756781606\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738160/extras/4850a9ce170a31113ee33fe6449edf0d.mp4?t=1756781606\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u>SABOTAGE YOUR OPPONENT</u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steal sabotage tokens from the conveyor belt and spin the Sabaslot machine to get a competitive edge! Four different sabotages can be used strategically to stop (or just annoy) your friends!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738160/extras/a65c21f774cee75a82c8ad9ce8a8d9ad.poster.avif?t=1756781606\" width=800 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738160/extras/a65c21f774cee75a82c8ad9ce8a8d9ad.webm?t=1756781606\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\